
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f8ff">
<meta name="description" content="Gündeşli Soft Ofis360 işletme yönetimi">
<title>Ofis360 | Gündeşli Soft</title>
<style>
:root{--blue:#1769e0;--blue2:#0e4ea9;--bg:#f5f7fb;--card:#fff;--ink:#182338;--muted:#718096;--line:#e5eaf2;--green:#14845b;--red:#c34343;--amber:#a66a0b;--radius:15px;--shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(25,45,80,.045)}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif}
button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}
button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:2px}
.app{min-height:100vh}
.sidebar{position:fixed;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:245px;background:#fff;border-right:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px 15px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;z-index:5;overflow:auto}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:0 8px 24px}
.brand-mark{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#2583ff,#1253bb);color:white;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:26px;font-weight:650;box-shadow:0 5px 14px #1769e025}
.brand-name{font-size:16px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.4px}
.brand-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.nav-label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.3px;color:#9aa5b5;font-weight:700;padding:12px 12px 7px}
.nav{display:grid;gap:4px}
.nav button{border:0;background:transparent;color:#637087;text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px}
.nav button:hover{background:#f4f7fc;color:var(--blue)}
.nav button.active{background:var(--blue-light,#eaf2ff);background:#eaf2ff;color:var(--blue);font-weight:600}
.nav-symbol{width:20px;text-align:center;font-size:16px}
.sidebar-bottom{margin-top:auto;padding:15px 9px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}
.main{margin-left:245px;min-width:0}
.topbar{height:70px;background:#ffffffdd;backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 30px;gap:15px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:4}
.top-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:620;letter-spacing:-.35px}
.top-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.top-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}
.content{padding:27px 30px 45px;max-width:1600px;margin:auto}
.page{display:none}.page.active{display:block}
.page-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:15px;margin-bottom:23px;flex-wrap:wrap}
h1{font-size:25px;letter-spacing:-.8px;font-weight:620;margin:0 0 5px}
h2{font-size:16px;font-weight:620;margin:0}
h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:620;margin:0}
.muted{color:var(--muted)}.small{font-size:12px}.tiny{font-size:11px}
.btn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 13px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;font-weight:550}
.btn:hover{border-color:#b8c8df;background:#f9fbff}
.btn.primary{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}
.btn.primary:hover{background:var(--blue2)}
.btn.danger{color:var(--red);border-color:#f0d3d3}
.btn.small-btn{padding:6px 9px;font-size:12px}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
.grid{display:grid;gap:16px}
.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));margin-bottom:19px}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:19px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);min-width:0}
.stat-label{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
.stat-value{font-size:27px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:9px 0 4px}
.stat-foot{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.two-col{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.45fr) minmax(280px,1fr)}
.three-col{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}
.card-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:17px}
.card-head p{margin:4px 0 0}
.table-wrap{overflow:auto;width:100%}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;white-space:nowrap}
th{text-align:left;font-size:11px;color:#8490a2;font-weight:600;padding:11px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
td{padding:12px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef1f6;font-size:12px;vertical-align:middle}
tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
tbody tr:hover{background:#fafcff}
.empty{text-align:center;padding:28px 12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
.field{display:grid;gap:6px;margin-bottom:14px}
.field label{font-size:12px;color:#5e6c81;font-weight:550}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;border:1px solid #dfe5ef;border-radius:9px;background:#fff;padding:10px 11px;color:var(--ink);min-width:0}
textarea{min-height:85px;resize:vertical}
input::placeholder,textarea::placeholder{color:#a5afbd}
.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:0 13px}
.full{grid-column:1/-1}
.toolbar{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:15px}
.toolbar input{max-width:290px}
.toolbar select{width:auto;min-width:145px}
.pill{display:inline-flex;border-radius:20px;padding:4px 8px;font-size:10px;background:#edf2f8;color:#637087}
.pill.green{background:#e5f6ee;color:#13784f}.pill.red{background:#fff0f0;color:#b43b3b}.pill.amber{background:#fff4dd;color:#93600b}.pill.blue{background:#eaf2ff;color:#1769e0}
.row-actions{display:flex;gap:6px}
.notice{border:1px solid #dbe8fb;background:#f2f7ff;border-radius:11px;padding:13px 15px;color:#425e86;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:17px}
.notice.warn{background:#fff8e9;border-color:#f3e2b7;color:#87621e}
.kpi-list{display:grid;gap:13px}
.kpi-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:12px}
.progress{height:6px;background:#edf1f7;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:7px}
.progress span{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--blue);border-radius:8px}
.quick-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}
.quick{padding:15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;text-align:left}
.quick:hover{border-color:#9bbcf0;background:#f8fbff}
.quick strong{display:block;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px}.quick span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.activity{display:grid;gap:13px}
.activity-item{display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:12px}
.activity-dot{width:8px;height:8px;background:#6fa5f5;border-radius:50%;margin-top:5px;flex-shrink:0}
.modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#101a2b66;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:18px;z-index:20}
.modal-backdrop.open{display:flex}
.modal{background:white;width:min(650px,100%);max-height:90vh;overflow:auto;border-radius:17px;box-shadow:0 25px 80px #101a2b30}
.modal-head{padding:20px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.modal-body{padding:20px 22px}
.modal-foot{padding:15px 22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:9px}
.close{border:0;background:#f1f4f8;border-radius:8px;width:31px;height:31px;font-size:18px;color:#68778c}
.toast{position:fixed;bottom:22px;right:22px;background:#17243a;color:white;padding:12px 17px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #0002;z-index:50;display:none;max-width:min(400px,calc(100% - 30px));font-size:12px}
.toast.show{display:block}
.guide-answer{background:#f5f8fd;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:15px;min-height:90px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:13px}
.guide-prompts{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0}
.guide-prompts button{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:7px 11px;font-size:11px;color:#53627a}
.section-divider{height:1px;background:var(--line);margin:17px 0}
.mobile-menu{display:none}
@media(max-width:1100px){.sidebar{width:215px}.main{margin-left:215px}.content{padding:23px 20px}.topbar{padding:0 20px}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.two-col{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:760px){.sidebar{transform:translateX(-100%);transition:transform .22s;width:250px;box-shadow:none}.sidebar.open{transform:translateX(0);box-shadow:15px 0 40px #17243a18}.main{margin-left:0}.topbar{height:63px;padding:0 14px}.content{padding:19px 13px 35px}.mobile-menu{display:inline-flex}.top-sub{display:none}.top-title{font-size:15px}.stats{gap:10px}.stat-value{font-size:23px}.card{padding:15px}.three-col{grid-template-columns:1fr}.quick-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.page-heading h1{font-size:22px}.form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.full{grid-column:auto}.toolbar input{max-width:none;flex:1;min-width:140px}.toolbar select{flex:1}.top-actions .hide-mobile{display:none}}
@media print{.sidebar,.topbar,.no-print,.modal-backdrop,.toast{display:none!important}.main{margin:0}.content{padding:0}.page{display:none!important}#printPage{display:block!important}.card{box-shadow:none;border:1px solid #ddd}body{background:#fff}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
<aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="brand-mark">G</div>
    <div><div class="brand-name">Gündeşli Soft</div><div class="brand-sub">Ofis360 İşletme Yönetimi</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="nav-label">ÇALIŞMA ALANI</div>
  <nav class="nav" id="mainNav">
    <button class="active" data-page="dashboard"><span class="nav-symbol">⌂</span> Genel Bakış</button>
    <button data-page="customers"><span class="nav-symbol">◎</span> Müşteriler</button>
    <button data-page="stock" data-sector="computer,phone"><span class="nav-symbol">▤</span> Stok Yönetimi</button>
    <button data-page="orders" data-sector="computer,phone"><span class="nav-symbol">⇄</span> Satış ve Siparişler</button>
    <button data-page="service" data-sector="computer,phone"><span class="nav-symbol">⌁</span> Teknik Servis</button>
    <button data-page="realestate" data-sector="realestate"><span class="nav-symbol">⌂</span> Gayrimenkul</button>
    <button data-page="phones" data-sector="phone"><span class="nav-symbol">▯</span> Telefon Cihazları</button>
    <button data-page="tasks"><span class="nav-symbol">✓</span> Görevler</button>
    <button data-page="reports"><span class="nav-symbol">▥</span> Raporlar</button>
    <button data-page="guide"><span class="nav-symbol">✳</span> Akıllı Rehber</button>
    <button data-page="settings"><span class="nav-symbol">⚙</span> Ayarlar ve Yedekleme</button>
  </nav>
  <div class="sidebar-bottom">Gündeşli Soft · Ofis360<br>Yerel prototip sürümü</div>
</aside>
<main class="main">
<header class="topbar">
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
    <button class="btn mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu" aria-label="Menüyü aç">☰</button>
    <div><div class="top-title" id="topTitle">Genel Bakış</div><div class="top-sub" id="businessSubtitle">İşletme yönetim merkezi</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="top-actions">
    <select id="sectorSwitcher" aria-label="İşletme sektörü" style="width:auto;max-width:190px">
      <option value="computer">Bilgisayar ve Güvenlik</option>
      <option value="realestate">Gayrimenkul / Emlak</option>
      <option value="phone">Telefoncu</option>
    </select>
    <button class="btn primary" id="quickAdd">＋ Yeni Kayıt</button>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="content">
<section class="page active" id="page-dashboard">
  <div class="page-heading"><div><h1>İşletmen için 360° kontrol.</h1><div class="muted">İşletme kayıtlarını, görevlerini ve temel göstergelerini tek yerden takip et.</div></div><button class="btn" id="dashExport">Yedek Al</button></div>
  <div class="grid stats">
    <div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Toplam Müşteri</div><div class="stat-value" id="statCustomers">0</div><div class="stat-foot">Kayıtlı müşteri</div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Stok Kalemi</div><div class="stat-value" id="statStock">0</div><div class="stat-foot" id="statStockFoot">Ürün ve cihaz</div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Açık Servis</div><div class="stat-value" id="statServices">0</div><div class="stat-foot">Tamamlanmamış kayıt</div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Bekleyen Görev</div><div class="stat-value" id="statTasks">0</div><div class="stat-foot">Tamamlanmamış görev</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid two-col">
    <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><div><h2>Hızlı işlemler</h2><p class="muted small">Sık kullanılan kayıt ekranları</p></div></div>
      <div class="quick-grid">
        <button class="quick" data-create="customer"><strong>Yeni müşteri</strong><span>Müşteri kartı oluştur</span></button>
        <button class="quick" data-create="stock" data-sector="computer,phone"><strong>Stok ekle</strong><span>Ürün veya cihaz kaydı</span></button>
        <button class="quick" data-create="order" data-sector="computer,phone"><strong>Satış / sipariş</strong><span>İşlem kaydı oluştur</span></button>
        <button class="quick" data-create="service" data-sector="computer,phone"><strong>Servis kabul</strong><span>Teknik servis kaydı</span></button>
        <button class="quick" data-create="property" data-sector="realestate"><strong>Yeni portföy</strong><span>Mülk kaydı oluştur</span></button>
        <button class="quick" data-create="task"><strong>Yeni görev</strong><span>Hatırlatma oluştur</span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><div><h2>Takip edilmesi gerekenler</h2><p class="muted small">Mevcut yerel kayıtlardan hesaplanır</p></div></div><div class="kpi-list" id="alertsList"></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid two-col" style="margin-top:16px">
    <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><div><h2>Son hareketler</h2><p class="muted small">En son oluşturulan kayıtlar</p></div></div><div class="activity" id="recentActivity"></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><div><h2>Stok durumu</h2><p class="muted small">Kritik seviyedeki kalemler</p></div><button class="btn small-btn" data-goto="stock" data-sector="computer,phone">Stokları aç</button></div><div id="criticalStock"></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page" id="page-customers">
  <div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Müşteriler</h1><div class="muted">Müşteri iletişim bilgileri ve geçmişi.</div></div><button class="btn primary" data-create="customer">＋ Müşteri ekle</button></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="toolbar"><input id="customerSearch" placeholder="Müşteri ara..."><select id="customerFilter"><option value="">Tüm müşteriler</option><option value="marketing">İletişim izni olanlar</option></select></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Müşteri</th><th>Telefon</th><th>E-posta</th><th>Eklenme</th><th>İzin</th><th>İşlem</th></tr></thead><tbody id="customersTable"></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section class="page" id="page-stock">
  <div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Stok Yönetimi</h1><div class="muted">Ürün, cihaz, miktar, maliyet ve kritik stok takibi.</div></div><button class="btn primary" data-create="stock">＋ Stok ekle</button></div>
  <div class="grid stats"><div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Ürün çeşidi</div><div class="stat-value" id="stockKinds">0</div></div><div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Toplam adet</div><div class="stat-value" id="stockUnits">0</div></div><div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Kritik stok</div><div class="stat-value" id="stockCritical">0</div></div><div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Tahmini maliyet</div><div class="stat-value" id="stockCost">₺0</div></div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="toolbar"><input id="stockSearch" placeholder="Ürün, kod veya kategori ara..."><button class="btn" id="exportStock">CSV dışa aktar</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Ürün</th><th>Kod</th><th>Kategori</th><th>Adet</th><th>Min.</th><th>Maliyet</th><th>Satış fiyatı</th><th>Durum</th><th>İşlem</th></tr></thead><tbody id="stockTable"></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section class="page" id="page-orders">
  <div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Satış ve Siparişler</h1><div class="muted">Satış, sipariş ve ödeme durumunu takip et.</div></div><button class="btn primary" data-create="order">＋ Yeni işlem</button></div>
  <div class="grid stats"><div class="card"><div class="stat-label">İşlem sayısı</div><div class="stat-value" id="orderCount">0</div></div><div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Toplam tutar</div><div class="stat-value" id="orderTotal">₺0</div></div><div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Tahsil edilen</div><div class="stat-value" id="orderPaid">₺0</div></div><div class="card"><div class="stat-label">Kalan tutar</div><div class="stat-value" id="orderDue">₺0</div></div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="toolbar"><input id="orderSearch" placeholder="İşlem veya müşteri ara..."><select id="orderStatusFilter"><option value="">Tüm durumlar</option><option>Bekliyor</option><option>Hazırlanıyor</option><option>Tamamlandı</option><option>İptal</option></select><button class="btn" id="exportOrders">CSV dışa aktar</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Tarih</th><th>İşlem</th><th>Müşteri</th><th>Tür</th><th>Tutar</th><th>Ödenen</th><th>Durum</th><th>İşlem</th></tr></thead><tbody id="ordersTable"></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section class="page" id="page-service">
  <div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Teknik Servis</h1><div class="muted">Cihaz kabulünden teslimata kadar servis takibi.</div></div><button class="btn primary" data-create="service">＋ Servis kabul</button></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="toolbar"><input id="serviceSearch" placeholder="Müşteri, cihaz veya arıza ara..."><select id="serviceStatusFilter"><option value="">Tüm durumlar</option><option>Kabul edildi</option><option>İncelemede</option><option>Parça bekliyor</option><option>Onarımda</option><option>Teslime hazır</option><option>Teslim edildi</option></select></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Servis no</th><th>Müşteri</th><th>Cihaz</th><th>Arıza</th><th>Kabul</th><th>Durum</th><th>Ücret</th><th>İşlem</th></tr></thead><tbody id="servicesTable"></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section class="page" id="page-realestate">
  <div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Gayrimenkul / Emlak</h1><div class="muted">Portföy, fiyat, konum ve ilan durumu.</div></div><button class="btn primary" data-create="property">＋ Portföy ekle</button></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="toolbar"><input id="propertySearch" placeholder="Portföy, konum veya malik ara..."><select id="propertyStatusFilter"><option value="">Tüm ilanlar</option><option>Satılık</option><option>Kiralık</option><option>İşlemde</option><option>Kapandı</option></select></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Portföy</th><th>Tür</th><th>İlan</th><th>Konum</th><th>Fiyat</th><th>Malik</th><th>Durum</th><th>İşlem</th></tr></thead><tbody id="propertiesTable"></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section class="page" id="page-phones">
  <div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Telefon Cihazları</h1><div class="muted">Telefon alım-satımı ve seri/IMEI kaydı.</div></div><button class="btn primary" data-create="phone">＋ Cihaz ekle</button></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="toolbar"><input id="phoneSearch" placeholder="Marka, model veya IMEI ara..."><select id="phoneStatusFilter"><option value="">Tüm cihazlar</option><option>Stokta</option><option>Satıldı</option><option>Serviste</option><option>İade</option></select></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Marka / model</th><th>IMEI / Seri</th><th>Alış</th><th>Satış</th><th>Durum</th><th>İşlem</th></tr></thead><tbody id="phonesTable"></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section class="page" id="page-tasks">
  <div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Görevler ve Hatırlatmalar</h1><div class="muted">Takip edilmesi gereken işleri ve tarihleri yönet.</div></div><button class="btn primary" data-create="task">＋ Görev ekle</button></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="toolbar"><input id="taskSearch" placeholder="Görev ara..."><select id="taskStatusFilter"><option value="">Tüm görevler</option><option value="open">Bekleyen</option><option value="done">Tamamlanan</option></select></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Görev</th><th>İlgili kişi</th><th>Son tarih</th><th>Öncelik</th><th>Durum</th><th>İşlem</th></tr></thead><tbody id="tasksTable"></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section class="page" id="page-reports">
  <div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Raporlar</h1><div class="muted">Mevcut kayıtların özetini görüntüle ve dışa aktar.</div></div><button class="btn" id="exportAllCsv">Müşterileri CSV aktar</button></div>
  <div class="notice">Bu raporlar yalnızca bu tarayıcıda kayıtlı veriler üzerinden hesaplanır. Resmî muhasebe veya e-fatura sistemi değildir.</div>
